hadiths[67]{hadithnumber,text}:
"425","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apney haath kandhon key baraabar uthaatey they jab namaz shuru kartey. Aur jab ruku key liye takbeer kehtey aur jab ruku se apna sar uthaatey to un donon ko aisa hi uthaatey aur farmatey: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd karta hai, ae hamaarey Rab aur terey liye hamd hai. Aur Aap sajdey mein aisa na kartey they. (Bukhari: 735)"
"426","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Logon ko hukm diya jaata tha ke aadmi namaz mein apna daayaan haath apni baaen kalaai par rakkhey. (Bukhari: 740)"
"427","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziallahu anhum) namaz ki ibteda (Alhamdu lillahi Rabbil Aalameen) se kartey they. (Bukhari: 743)"
"428","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takbeer aur qiraat key darmiyaan khaamosh rehtey they. To main ne kaha: Merey maan baap Aap par qurbaan Ya Rasulullah! Takbeer aur qiraat key darmiyaan Aapki khaamoshi mein Aap kya kehtey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Main kehta hun: Ae Allah! Merey aur meri khataaon key darmiyaan doori kar dey jaisey tune mashriq aur maghrib key darmiyaan doori ki hai. Ae Allah! Mujhey khataaon se paak kar dey jaisey safed kapda mail se paak kya jaata hai. Ae Allah! Meri khataaon ko paani aur barf aur oalon se dho dey. (Bukhari: 744)"
"429","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se suraj gehan ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mujh se qareeb ho gai yahan tak ke agar main us par jurrat karta to tumharey paas uskey phalon mein se phal laata. Aur aag mujh se qareeb ho gai yahan tak ke main ne kaha: Ae merey Rab! Kya main unkey sath hun? Phir aik aurat, mera khayaal hai ke unhon-ne farmaya, usey billi noch rahi thi. Main ne kaha: Iska kya haal hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Us ne use qaid kar rakkha yahan tak ke wo bhook se mar gai. Na use khilaaya aur na use chhoda ke wo khaey. Unhon-ne kaha: Mera khayaal hai ke unhon-ne farmaya: Zameen key keedon ya hasharat mein se. (Bukhari: 745)"
"430","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se suraj gehan ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mujh se qareeb ho gai yahan tak ke agar main us par jurrat karta to tumharey paas uskey phalon mein se phal laata. Aur aag mujh se qareeb ho gai yahan tak ke main ne kaha: Ae merey Rab! Kya main unkey sath hun? Phir aik aurat, mera khayaal hai ke unhon-ne farmaya, usey billi noch rahi thi. Main ne kaha: Iska kya haal hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Us ne use qaid kar rakkha yahan tak ke wo bhook se mar gai. Na use khilaaya aur na use chhoda ke wo khaey. Unhon-ne kaha: Mera khayaal hai ke unhon-ne farmaya: Zameen key keedon ya hasharat mein se. (Bukhari: 745)"
"431","[AI-translation] Khabbaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se kaha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar aur Asr mein padhtey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Ham ne kaha: Tum use kaisey jaantey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Aapki daadhi hilney se. (Bukhari: 746)"
"432","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ka kya haal hai jo apni namazon mein apni nigaahein aasmaan ki taraf uthaatey hain? To Aap ka qaul uskey baarey mein sakht hua yahan tak ke farmaya: Wo us se zaroor baaz aaein ya unki nigaahein uchak li jaaengi. (Bukhari: 750)"
"433","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se namaz mein idhar udhar dekhney key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo uchak lena hai jo shaitaan bandey ki namaz mein se uchak leta hai. (Bukhari: 751)"
"434","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kufa walon ne Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se Saad ki shikaayat ki. To unhon-ne unhey mazool kar diya aur un par Ammaar ko muqarrar kya. To unhon-ne shikaayat ki yahan tak ke zikr kya ke wo achhi tarah namaz nahi padhtey. To unhon-ne unki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Ae Abu Ishaaq! Beshak ye gumaan kartey hain ke tum achhi tarah namaz nahi padhtey? Abu Ishaaq ne kaha: Lekin main Allah ki qasam! Beshak main unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz padhaata tha, us se kam na karta tha. Main Isha ki namaz padhaata, pehli donon mein thehar kar padhta aur aakhri donon mein halki padhta. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Abu Ishaaq! Tumharey baarey mein yehi gumaan hai. To unhon-ne unkey sath aik aadmi ya aadmi Kufa ki taraf bhejey. To us ne Kufa walon se unkey baarey mein poochha aur koi masjid na chhodi magar uskey baarey mein poochha. Aur wo achha kehtey they. Yahan tak ke Bani Abs ki masjid mein daakhil hua. To un mein se aik aadmi khada hua jisey Usaama bin Qataada kaha jaata hai, jiski kunniyat Abu Saada hai. Us ne kaha: Jab tum ne hamein qasam di hai to beshak Saad lashkar key sath na chaltey they aur na baraabari se taqseem kartey they aur na muqadmey mein insaaf kartey they. Saad ne kaha: Lekin Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor teen duaaein karunga: Ae Allah! Agar tera ye banda jhootha hai, dikhaawey aur shohrat key liye khada hua hai, to uski umr lambi kar aur uska faqr lamba kar aur usey fitnon mein daal. Aur uskey baad jab us se poochha jaata to kehta: Budha bada aazmaish mein pada hua, mujhey Saad ki baddua lagi hai. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat karney waley raawi ne kaha: To main ne usey uskey baad dekha ke uski bhanwein budhaapey se uski aankhon par gir gai thein aur beshak wo raaston mein londiyon key liye nikalta aur unhey ishaara karta tha. (Bukhari: 755)"
"435","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uski namaz nahi jis ne Surah Faatiha na padhi. (Bukhari: 756)"
"436","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein daakhil huey. To aik aadmi daakhil hua aur namaz padhi aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kya. To Aap ne jawaab diya aur farmaya: Wapas jao aur namaz padho, beshak tum ne namaz nahi padhi. To wo wapas gaya aur namaz padhi jaisey us ne padhi thi. Phir aaya aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Wapas jao aur namaz padho, beshak tum ne namaz nahi padhi. Teen martaba. To us ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jis ne tumhey haq key sath bheja! Main uskey siwa achhi tarah nahi jaanta, to mujhey sikhaaeye. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum namaz key liye khadey ho to takbeer kaho, phir jo tumhey Quran mein se aasaan ho padho. Phir ruku karo yahan tak ke ruku mein mutmaen ho jaao. Phir utho yahan tak ke khadey honay mein baraabar ho jaao. Phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajdey mein mutmaen ho jaao. Phir utho yahan tak ke baithney mein mutmaen ho jaao. Aur apni saari namaz mein aisa karo. (Bukhari: 757)"
"437","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar ki pehli do rakatein Surah Faatiha aur do suratein padhtey they. Pehli mein lambi kartey aur doosri mein chhoti, aur kabhi aayat sunaatay. Aur Asr mein Surah Faatiha aur do suratein padhtey they. Aur pehli mein lambi kartey aur doosri mein chhoti. Aur Subah ki namaz ki pehli rakat mein lambi kartey aur doosri mein chhoti. (Bukhari: 759)"
"438","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Umm-ul-Fazl ne unhey (Walmursalaati Urfa) padhtey huey suna. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey betey! Allah ki qasam! Beshak tum ne apni is surat key padhney se mujhey yaad dila diya hai. Beshak wo aakhri hai jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Maghrib mein padhtey huey suni. (Bukhari: 763)"
"439","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne Nabi ko Maghrib mein lambi do (suraton) mein se lambi wali padhtey huey suna. (Bukhari: 764)"
"440","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein Toor padhtey huey suna. (Bukhari: 765)"
"441","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Abul Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey Isha padhi. To Aap ne (Izas Samaaun Shaqqat) padhi aur sajda kya. To main uskey sath sajda karta rahunga yahan tak ke Aap se milun. (Bukhari: 768)"
"442","[AI-translation] Aur aik doosri riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aur main ne kisi ko Aap se zyada achhi aawaaz ya qiraat wala nahi suna. (Bukhari: 769)"
"443","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Har namaz mein padha jaata hai. To jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein sunaaya ham ne tumhey sunaaya. Aur jo ham se chhupaaya ham ne tum se chhupaaya. Aur agar tum Umm-ul-Quran par izaafa na karo to kaafi hai. Aur agar zyada karo to behtar hai. (Bukhari: 772)"
"444","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sahaaba ki aik jamaat mein Ukaaz key baazaar ki taraf qasd kar key nikley jabke shaitaanon aur aasmaan ki khabar key darmiyaan rukawat daal di gai thi aur un par shahaab bhejey gaey they. To shaitaan apni qaum ki taraf wapas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey kya hua? To unhon-ne kaha: Hamaarey aur aasmaan ki khabar key darmiyaan rukawat daal di gai hai aur ham par shahaab bhejey gaey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Tumharey aur aasmaan ki khabar key darmiyaan koi nai baat key siwa rukawat nahi hui hai. To zameen key mashriq aur maghrib mein phail jao aur dekho ye kya hai jo tumharey aur aasmaan ki khabar key darmiyaan haael hua hai. To wo jo Tihaama ki taraf gaey they Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf wapas aey jabke Aap Nakhla mein Ukaaz key baazaar ki taraf qasd kartey huey they aur Aap apne sahaaba ko Fajr padha rahey they. Phir jab unhon-ne Quran suna to usey ghaur se suna aur kaha: Allah ki qasam! Yehi hai jo tumharey aur aasmaan ki khabar key darmiyaan haael hua hai. To wahein jab wo apni qaum ki taraf wapas gaey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ae hamaari qaum! (Beshak ham ne ajeeb Quran suna hai jo bhalai ki taraf hidaayat karta hai, to ham us par imaan laaey aur ham apne Rab key sath kisi ko shareek na karengey). To Allah ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par naazil farmaya: (Kaho: Meri taraf wahi ki gai hai ke jinon key aik giroh ne suna). Aur Aapki taraf sirf jinon ka qaul wahi kya gaya tha. (Bukhari: 773)"
"445","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahaan padha jahaan Aapko hukm diya gaya aur wahaan khaamosh rahey jahaan Aapko hukm diya gaya. (Aur tumhara Rab bhoolney wala nahi hai). (Beshak tumharey liye Rasulullah mein umda namoona hai). (Bukhari: 774). Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ansaar mein se aik aadmi Quba ki masjid mein unhey imamat karaata tha. Aur jab bhi wo koi surat shuru karta jo wo unhey namaz mein padhta tha, us se pehley Qul Huwallahu Ahad se shuru karta yahan tak ke us se faarigh hota. Phir uskey sath doosri surat padhta. Aur wo har rakat mein aisa karta tha. To uskey saathiyon ne us se baat ki aur kaha: Tum is surat se shuru kartey ho, phir nahi samajhtey ke wo tumhey kaafi hai yahan tak ke doosri padhtey ho. To ya use padho ya use chhoro aur doosri padho. To us ne kaha: Main use chhorney wala nahi hun. Agar tum pasand kartey ho ke main tumhey uskey sath imamat karaaun to karunga, aur agar naapasand kartey ho to tumhey chhor dunga. Aur wo samajhtey they ke wo un mein sab se afzal hai aur naapasand kartey they ke unhey uskey siwa koi imamat karaaey. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas aey to unhon-ne Aap ko khabar sunaai. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae fulaan! Tumhey kya rokta hai ke tum wo karo jo tumharey saathi tumhey hukm detey hain, aur tumhey har rakat mein is surat ko laazim pakadney par kya ubhaarta hai? To us ne kaha: Beshak main us se mohabbat rakhta hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhaari us se mohabbat tumhey Jannat mein daakhil karegi. (774). Aur yahaan izaafa hai jo (saloohu) wali hadees mein nahi hai. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"446","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unkey paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Main ne Mufassal raat ko aik rakat mein padha. To unhon-ne kaha: Shair ki tarah jaldi jaldi! Beshak main un hamsar (suraton) ko jaanta hun jinhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mila kar padhtey they. To unhon-ne Mufassal mein se bees suratein zikr kein, har rakat mein do suratein. (Bukhari: 775)"
"447","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar mein pehli donon mein Umm-ul-Kitaab aur do suratein padhtey they. Aur aakhri do rakatein mein Umm-ul-Kitaab. Aur hamein aayat sunaatay. Aur pehli rakat mein lambi kartey jitni doosri rakat mein lambi na kartey. Aur Asr mein aisa hi aur Subah mein aisa hi. (Bukhari: 776)"
"448","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Imam Aameen kahey to Aameen kaho. Beshak jiski Aameen farishton ki Aameen key muwaafiq hui uskey pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 781)"
"449","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Aameen kahey aur aasmaan mein farishtey Aameen kahein aur aik doosrey key muwaafiq ho to uskey pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 781)"
"450","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas pahunchey jabke Aap ruku mein they. To saf tak pahunchaney se pehley ruku kya. To unhon-ne uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhaari hirs badhaaey aur dobaara (aisa) na karo. (Bukhari: 783)"
"451","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) key sath Basra mein namaz padhi. To unhon-ne kaha: Is aadmi ne hamein wo namaz yaad dilaai jo ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath padhtey they. To unhon-ne zikr kya ke wo har uthney aur jhukney mein takbeer kehtey they. (Bukhari: 784)"
"452","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab namaz key liye khadey hotey to khadey hotey waqt takbeer kehtey, phir ruku kartey waqt takbeer kehtey. Phir kehtey: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd karta hai, jab ruku se apni peeth uthaatey. Phir khadey honay ki haalat mein kehtey: Ae hamaarey Rab aur terey liye hamd hai. Phir jhuktey waqt takbeer kehtey. Phir apna sar uthaatey waqt takbeer kehtey. Phir sajda kartey waqt takbeer kehtey. Phir apna sar uthaatey waqt takbeer kehtey. Phir saari namaz mein aisa kartey yahan tak ke use poori kartey. Aur do (rakatein) key baad baithney se uthtey waqt takbeer kehtey. (Bukhari: 789)"
"453","[AI-translation] Musab bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Main ne apne waalid key pehlu mein namaz padhi aur apni hatheliyon ko milaaya phir unhey apni raanon key darmiyaan rakkha. To merey waalid ne mujhey mana kya aur kaha: Ham aisa kartey they to hamein us se mana kar diya gaya aur hamein hukm diya gaya ke ham apney haath ghutnon par rakkhein. (Bukhari: 790)"
"454","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ruku aur Aap ka sajda aur donon sajdon key darmiyaan aur jab ruku se apna sar uthaatey, qiyaam aur qood key siwa, baraabari key qareeb they. (Bukhari: 792)"
"455","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ruku aur sajdey mein kehtey they: Paak hai tu Ae Allah ae hamaarey Rab aur teri hamd key sath, Ae Allah mujhey maaf farma. (Bukhari: 794)"
"456","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik doosri riwayat mein hai: Quran par amal kartey huey. (Bukhari: 817)"
"457","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Imam kahey: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd karta hai, to kaho: Ae Allah ae hamaarey Rab terey liye hamd hai. Beshak jiska qaul farishton key qaul key muwaafiq hua uskey pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 796)"
"458","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz zaroor qareeb karunga. To Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) Zohar ki namaz ki aakhri rakat mein aur Isha ki namaz aur Subah ki namaz mein (Sami Allahu liman hamidah) kehney key baad qunoot padhtey they. To mominon key liye dua kartey aur kaafiron par laanat kartey. (Bukhari: 797)"
"459","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Qunoot Maghrib aur Fajr mein tha. (Bukhari: 798)"
"460","[AI-translation] Rifaaa bin Raafe Zuraqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham aik din Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey namaz padh rahey they. Phir jab Aap ne rakat se apna sar uthaaya to farmaya: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd karta hai. Aap key peechey aik aadmi ne kaha: Ae hamaarey Rab aur terey liye hamd hai, bahut paakiza barkat wali hamd. Phir jab Aap phirey to farmaya: Baat karney wala kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Main. Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tees se zyada farishton ko dekha jo uski taraf daud rahey they ke un mein se kaun use pehley likhta hai. (Bukhari: 799)"
"461","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo hamein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz bataatey they. To Aap namaz padhtey aur jab ruku se apna sar uthaatey to khadey rehtey yahan tak ke ham kehtey ke Aap bhool gaey hain. (Bukhari: 800)"
"462","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apna sar uthaatey to kehtey: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd karta hai, ae hamaarey Rab aur terey liye hamd hai. Aadmiyon key liye dua kartey aur unhey unkey naamon se pukaartey. To farmatey: Ae Allah! Waleed bin Waleed aur Salma bin Hishaam aur Ayyaash bin Abi Rabeea aur mominon mein se kamzoron ko najaat dey. Ae Allah! Muzar par apna dabao sakht kar aur use un par Yusuf key saalon jaisa kar dey. Aur mashriq waley us din Muzar mein se Aap key mukhaalif they. (Bukhari: 804)"
"463","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham Qiyaamat key din apne Rab ko dekhengey? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum chaand key baarey mein jhagadtey ho chaandni raat mein jabke uskey neechey baadal na ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: To kya tum sooraj key baarey mein jhagadtey ho jabke uskey neechey baadal na ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak tum use aisa dekhogey. Log Qiyaamat key din jama kiye jaaengey. To wo farmaaeyga: Jo kisi cheez ki ibaadat karta tha wo uskey peechey chaley. To un mein se koi sooraj key peechey chalega aur un mein se koi chaand key peechey chalega aur un mein se koi taaghooton key peechey chalega. Aur ye ummat reh jaaeygi jis mein uskey munaafiq hongey. To unkey paas Allah aaeyga aur farmaaeyga: Main tumhara Rab hun. To wo kahengey: Ye hamaari jagah hai yahan tak ke hamaarey paas hamaara Rab aaey. Phir jab hamaara Rab aaeyga to ham usey pehchaanengey. To unkey paas Allah aaeyga aur farmaaeyga: Main tumhara Rab hun. To wo kahengey: Tum hamaarey Rab ho. To wo unhey bulaaeyga. To Jahannum ki peeth par pul rakkha jaaeyga. To main Rasoolon mein sab se pehla hunga jo apni ummat key sath guzrega. Aur us din Rasoolon key siwa koi baat na karega. Aur Rasoolon ki baat us din hogi: Ae Allah! Salaamat rakkh, salaamat rakkh! Aur Jahannum mein aankdey hain Saa daan key kaanton jaisey. Kya tum ne Saa daan key kaantey dekhey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To beshak wo Saa daan key kaanton jaisey hain, magar ye ke unki badaai ka andaza Allah key siwa koi nahi jaanta. Wo logon ko unkey aamaal key sath uchak lengey. To un mein se koi apne amal key sath halaak hoga aur un mein se koi ragra jaaeyga phir najaat paaeyga. Yahan tak ke jab Allah aag walon mein se jis par chaahega rehem karna chaahega to Allah farishton ko hukm dega ke jo Allah ki ibaadat karta tha use nikaal dein. To wo unhey nikaalengey aur unhey sajdey key nishaanon se pehchaanengey. Aur Allah ne aag par sajdey key nishaan ko khaana haraam kar diya hai. To wo aag se nikalengey. To Aadam key har betey ko aag khaaeygi magar sajdey key nishaan ko. To wo aag se nikalengey jabke jal chukey hongey. To un par Aab-e-Hayaat daala jaaeyga. To wo ugengey jaisey daana sailaab key bojh mein ugta hai. Phir Allah bandon key darmiyaan faisley se faarigh hoga. Aur aik aadmi Jannat aur aag key darmiyaan reh jaaeyga. Aur wo aag walon mein Jannat mein daakhil honay wala aakhri hai. Uska chehra aag ki taraf hoga. To wo kahega: Ae merey Rab! Mera chehra aag se pher dey. Beshak uski boo ne mujhey kharaab kar diya hai aur uski lapak ne mujhey jala diya hai. To wo farmaaeyga: Kya mumkin hai ke agar tumharey sath aisa kya gaya to tum uskey siwa maangogey? To wo kahega: Nahi, teri izzat ki qasam! To wo Allah ko jo wo chaahega ahd aur meesaaq dega. To Allah uska chehra aag se pher dega. Phir jab wo usey Jannat ki taraf karega aur uski raunaq dekhega to jitna Allah chaahega ke wo khaamosh rahey khaamosh rahega. Phir kahega: Ae merey Rab! Mujhey Jannat key darwaazey key paas kar dey. To Allah us se farmaaeyga: Kya tum ne ahd aur meesaaq nahi diye they ke tum uskey siwa na maangogey jo tum ne maanga tha? To wo kahega: Ae merey Rab! Main teri makhlooq mein sab se badnaseeb na hunga. To wo farmaaeyga: To kya mumkin hai ke agar tumhey wo diya gaya to tum uskey siwa na maangogey? To wo kahega: Nahi, teri izzat ki qasam! Main uskey siwa na maangunga. To wo apne Rab ko jo wo chaahega ahd aur meesaaq dega. To wo usey Jannat key darwaazey tak kar dega. Phir jab wo uskey darwaazey tak pahunchega aur uski taazgi aur jo us mein khushi aur surur hai dekhega to jitna Allah chaahega ke wo khaamosh rahey khaamosh rahega. To wo kahega: Ae merey Rab! Mujhey Jannat mein daakhil kar dey. To Allah farmaaeyga: Afsos tujh par ae Aadam key betey! Kitna dhokebaaz hai! Kya tum ne ahd aur meesaaq nahi diye they ke tum uskey siwa na maangogey jo tumhey diya gaya. To wo kahega: Ae merey Rab! Mujhey apni makhlooq mein sab se badnaseeb na bana. To Allah us se hansega, phir usey Jannat mein daakhil honay ki ijazat dega. To farmaaeyga: Tamanna karo. To wo tamanna karega yahan tak ke jab uski tamanna kat jaaeygi to Allah farmaaeyga: Fulaan fulaan se. Uska Rab usey yaad dilaata rahega. Yahan tak ke jab us se tamannaein khatm ho jaaengi to Allah Taala farmaaeyga: Tumharey liye wo hai aur uskey sath us jaisa. Abu Saeed Khudri ne Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Tumharey liye wo hai aur das guna us jaisa. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey qaul (tumharey liye wo hai aur uskey sath us jaisa) key siwa yaad nahi kya. Abu Saeed ne kaha: Beshak main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna hai: Tumharey liye aur das guna us jaisa. (Bukhari: 806)"
"464","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke main saat haddiyon par sajda karun: Peshaani par, aur Aap ne apne haath se apni naak ki taraf ishaara kya, aur donon haathon aur donon ghutnon aur donon qadmon key kinaaron par. Aur ham kapdon aur baalon ko na sametein. (Bukhari: 812)"
"465","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main kotahi nahi karta ke tumhey namaz padhaaun jaisa main ne Nabi ko (padhtey huey) dekha hai. Aur baaqi hadees guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 821)"
"466","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sajdey mein etedaal karo aur tum mein se koi apne baazu kuttey key phailney ki tarah na phailaaey. (Bukhari: 822)"
"467","[AI-translation] Maalik bin Huwairis Laisi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko namaz padhtey huey dekha. Phir jab Aap apni namaz key taaq (rakat) mein hotey to na uthtey yahan tak ke baraabar baith jaatey. (Bukhari: 823)"
"468","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne namaz padhi aur takbeer buland aawaaz se kahi jab apna sar sajdey se uthaaya aur jab sajda kya aur jab uthaaya aur jab do rakatein se uthay. Aur kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa dekha hai. (Bukhari: 825)"
"469","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo namaz mein jab baithey to chaukdi maar kar baithey. Aur unhon-ne apne betey ko aisa kartey huey dekha to use mana kya aur kaha: Beshak namaz ki sunnat ye hai ke tum apna daayaan paon khada rakkho aur baayaan modey. To us ne un se kaha: Beshak tum aisa kartey ho. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak merey paon mujhey nahi uthaatey. (Bukhari: 827)"
"470","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main tum mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz ka sab se zyada yaad rakhney wala tha. Main ne Aap ko dekha ke jab Aap takbeer kehtey to apney haath kandhon key baraabar rakhtey. Aur jab ruku kartey to apney haath ghutnon par jamatey, phir apni peeth jhukaatey. Phir jab apna sar uthaatey to seedhey hotey yahan tak ke har jod apni jagah wapas aa jaata. Phir jab sajda kartey to apney haath rakhtey, na bichhaatey aur na unhey samet-tey. Aur apne pairon ki ungliyon key kinaaron se qibley ki taraf rukh kartey. Phir jab do rakatein mein baithey to apne baaen paon par baithey aur daayaan khada rakhtey. Aur jab aakhri rakat mein baithey to apna baayaan paon aagey kartey aur doosra khada rakhtey aur apne baithney ki jagah par baithey. (Bukhari: 828)"
"471","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Buhaina (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur wo Azd Shanuah mein se hain aur Bani Abd Manaaf key haleef hain. Aur wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se they: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey Zohar padhaai. To pehli do rakatein mein khadey ho gaey aur na baithey. To log Aap key sath khadey ho gaey yahan tak ke jab Aap ne namaz poori ki aur log Aap key salaam ka intezaar kar rahey they. To Aap ne takbeer kahi jabke Aap baithey they aur salaam pherney se pehley do sajdey kiye, phir salaam phera. (Bukhari: 829)"
"472","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey namaz padhtey to kehtey: Salaam ho Jibreel aur Mikaael par, salaam ho fulaan aur fulaan par. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaari taraf mutawajjeh huey aur farmaya: Beshak Allah hi Salaam hai. Phir jab tum mein se koi namaz padhey to kahey: Tamaam zabaan ki ibaadatein Allah key liye aur namazein aur paak cheezein. Salaam ho tum par ae Nabi aur Allah ki rehmat aur uski barkatein. Salaam ho ham par aur Allah key nek bandon par. Beshak jab tum ye kahogey to aasmaan aur zameen mein Allah key har nek bandey ko pahunchegi. Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. (Bukhari: 831)"
"473","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz mein dua kartey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main qabr key azaab se teri panaah maangta hun. Aur teri panaah maangta hun Maseeh Dajjaal key fitney se. Aur teri panaah maangta hun zindagi aur maut key fitney se. Ae Allah! Beshak main gunaah aur qarz se teri panaah maangta hun. To un se aik kehney waley ne kaha: Tum qarz se kitni panaah maangtey ho! To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi jab qarzdaar hota hai to baat karta hai aur jhoot bolta hai aur waada karta hai aur khilaaf karta hai. (Bukhari: 832)"
"474","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr Siddique (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhey dua sikhaaeye jo main apni namaz mein maangun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne apne aap par bahut zulm kya hai aur gunaahon ko terey siwa koi nahi maaf karta. To mujhey apne paas se maghfirat dey aur mujh par rehem farma. Beshak tu hi bahut Maaf karney wala Rehem karney wala hai. (Bukhari: 834)"
"475","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki tashahhud mein hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya uskey qaul (main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain) key baad: Phir dua mein se jo use pasand ho muntakhib karey aur dua karey. (Bukhari: 835)"
"476","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab salaam phertey to Aap key salaam poora karney par auratein uthteen aur Aap uthney se pehley thodi der thehartey. (Bukhari: 837)"
"477","[AI-translation] Itbaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padhi aur jab Aap ne salaam phera to ham ne salaam phera. (Bukhari: 838)"
"478","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke farz se faarigh honay par logon key wapas jaaney key waqt zikr se aawaaz buland karna Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein tha. Aur Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main jaanta tha ke wo wapas gaey hain us se jab main use sunta tha. (Bukhari: 841)"
"479","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Fuqara Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Maaldaar maal waley buland darjon aur hamesha rehne wali nemat key sath (aagey) gaey. Wo namaz padhtey hain jaisey ham padhtey hain aur rozey rakhtey hain jaisey ham rakhtey hain. Aur unkey paas maalon mein se fazeelat hai jin se wo Hajj kartey hain aur Umrah kartey hain aur jihaad kartey hain aur sadqa detey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey na bataun ke agar tum use apnaao to jo tum se aagey badh gaey unhey paa logey aur tumhey tumharey baad koi na paaeyga. Aur tum un mein sab se behtar hongey jinkey darmiyaan tum ho, magar jo us jaisa amal karey. Tum har namaz key peechey taentees taentees martaba tasbeeh aur hamd aur takbeer kaho. Raawi ne kaha: To ham ne aapas mein ikhtelaaf kya. To ham mein se baaz ne kaha: Ham taentees martaba tasbeeh kahengey aur taentees martaba hamd kahengey aur chauntees martaba takbeer kahengey. To main uski taraf wapas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: SubhanAllah walhamdu lillah wallahu Akbar, yahan tak ke un sab mein se taentees taentees ho jaaein. (Bukhari: 843)"
"480","[AI-translation] Mugheera bin Shoaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har farz namaz key peechey kehtey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, Akela, uska koi shareek nahi. Uskey liye baadshahat hai aur uskey liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qaadir hai. Ae Allah! Jo tune diya use koi rokney wala nahi aur jo tune roka use koi deney wala nahi. Aur maaldaar ko tujh se uski maal-daari faeda nahi degi. (Bukhari: 844)"
"481","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab namaz padhtey to apne chehrey key sath hamaari taraf mutawajjeh hotey. (Bukhari: 845)"
"482","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khaalid Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Hudaibiya mein Subah ki namaz padhaai, raat ki baarish key baad. Phir jab Aap phirey to logon ki taraf mutawajjeh huey aur farmaya: Kya tum jaantey ho ke tumharey Rab ne kya farmaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaanney waley hain. Aap ne farmaya: Merey bandon mein se subah momin aur kaafir hua. To jis ne kaha: Ham par Allah key fazl aur uski rehmat se baarish hui, to wo mujh par imaan rakhney wala hai aur sitaarey ka inkaar karney wala hai. Aur jis ne kaha: Fulaan fulaan sitaarey (key tulu) se, to wo mujh ka inkaar karney wala hai aur sitaarey par imaan rakhney wala hai. (Bukhari: 846)"
"483","[AI-translation] Uqba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey Madina mein Asr padhi. To Aap ne salaam phera phir jaldi se uthay aur logon ki gardano ko phalaangtey huey apni biwiyon key baaz hujron ki taraf gaey. To log Aapki jaldi se ghabraaey. To Aap unkey paas nikley aur dekha ke wo Aapki jaldi par taajjub kar rahey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey hamaarey paas soney chaandi key tukdey yaad aey. To main ne naapasand kya ke wo mujhey rokey. To main ne usey taqseem karney ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 851)"
"484","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Tum mein se koi apni namaz mein se shaitaan key liye kuchh na rakkhey, ye samjhey ke us par haq hai ke wo daaen key siwa wapas na jaey. Beshak main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bahut baar baaen taraf se wapas jaatey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 852)"
"485","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo is darkht mein se khaey, Aap ka iraada lehsan tha, to wo hamaari masjidon mein hamaarey paas na aaey. Main ne kaha: Aap ka iraada kis se hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Mera khayaal hai ke Aap ka iraada sirf kachchey se hai. Aur kaha gaya: Magar uski boo se. (Bukhari: 854)"
"486","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo lehsan ya pyaaz khaey to wo ham se door rahey. Ya farmaya: Wo hamaari masjid se door rahey aur apne ghar mein baithay. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas haandi laai gai jis mein sabziyon mein se sabz cheezein thein. To Aap ne uski boo paai. To Aap ne poochha aur Aap ko uskey baarey mein khabar di gai jo us mein sabziyon mein se tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Use qareeb karo. Apne baaz sahaaba ki taraf jo Aap key sath they. Phir jab us ne dekha ke Aap ne usey khaana naapasand kya to us ne kaha: Khaao, beshak main us se sargoshi karta hun jis se tum sargoshi nahi kartey."
"487","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Badr laaya gaya, yaani thaaali jis mein sabz cheezein thein. (Bukhari: 855)"
"488","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) laawaaris qabr key paas se guzrey. To Aap ne unhey imamat karaai aur unhon-ne us par saf banaai. (Bukhari: 857)"
"489","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jumuah key din ghusl har baaligh par waajib hai. (Bukhari: 858)"
"490","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, aur un se aik aadmi ne kaha tha: Tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath nikalney mein haazir huey? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aur agar Aap key paas mera maqaam na hota to main haazir na hota, yaani apne chhotey honay ki wajah se. Aap us nishaan key paas aey jo Kaseer bin Salt key ghar key paas hai, phir khutba diya. Phir auraton key paas aey aur unhey waaz kiya aur unhey yaad dilaaya aur unhey hukm diya ke wo sadqa karein. To aurat apna haath apne halq ki taraf jhukaati aur Bilaal key kapdey mein daalti. Phir Aap aur Bilaal ghar aey. (Bukhari: 863)"
"491","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tumhaari auratein raat ko tum se masjid jaaney ki ijazat maangein to unhey ijazat do. (Bukhari: 865). Kitaab-ul-Jumuah."
